{"id":"n29001-1-7","stage":3,"title":"진찰 · 诊察","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29001-1-7-1","ko":"수술을 해야 하나요?","zh":"需要做手术吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"수술을","meaning":"手术","explanation":"수술：手术；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"수술","audio":"/audio/aa0808e7565c5a89c0bb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65022","senseId":"1","lemma":"수술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해야","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하나요?","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"aa0808e7565c5a89","term":"수술","zh":"手术","audio":"/audio/aa0808e7565c5a89c0bb.mp3","entryId":"65022","definition":"为了治病而对身体的一部分进行切除或缝合。","pronunciation":["수술"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干；应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6f137efd97acfa781af2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n29001-1-7-2","ko":"진찰 결과를 보니 수술은 하지 않아도 될 것 같습니다.","zh":"根据检查结果，看来不需要做手术了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"진찰","meaning":"诊察","explanation":"진찰：诊察","readings":[{"term":"진찰","audio":"/audio/4f3729e42bb96510e7ec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29001","senseId":"1","lemma":"진찰","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"결과를","meaning":"结果，结局","explanation":"결과：结果，结局；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"결과","audio":"/audio/109383e344db8ae54a47.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60093","senseId":"1","lemma":"결과","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보니","meaning":"推测","explanation":"보다：推测；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"20","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수술은","meaning":"手术","explanation":"수술：手术；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"수술","audio":"/audio/aa0808e7565c5a89c0bb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65022","senseId":"1","lemma":"수술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하지","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않아도","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71581","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"될","meaning":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","explanation":"되다：可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같습니다.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4f3729e42bb96510","term":"진찰","zh":"诊察","audio":"/audio/4f3729e42bb96510e7ec.mp3","entryId":"29001","definition":"医生为了进行治疗，诊视察验患者的病情。","pronunciation":["진ː찰"]},{"id":"109383e344db8ae5","term":"결과","zh":"结果，结局","audio":"/au